    "title": "横向打印销售单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/1a073a42e3396604957f6cb30a77f629.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/3469e41ab7ea8b82c7413a045610f5eb.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>受打印机进纸限制，横向打印操作步骤如下：</p>\n<p>1、进入打印模板编辑界面，先将【纸张类型】选择<strong>A4</strong></p>\n<p>3、旁边的【宽高】栏，手动输入<strong>实际纸张尺寸</strong></p>\n<p>3、在【打印设置-打印方向】中，勾选“<strong>横向</strong>”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/24dd89cf71837f8e3cea1a7209db9dbb.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202509/5bbe073b33783a6477cc66519651e533.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
